%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: StoryTable_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 232c66db683ee472ebf30c5c5cb5e662, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 4407004487680
    m_Localized: Deep in a lush forest, the Black Ant Village and the Termite Village
      stood side by side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4407033847808
    m_Localized: The ants of the two villages looked nothing alike, yet they always
      got along.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4407033847809
    m_Localized: Then one day, the two villages came together to hold a joyful festival.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4407033847810
    m_Localized: But the festival, once full of laughter, turned into a terrible
      battlefield in an instant.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4407033847811
    m_Localized: The Termite Queen had savagely bitten two young black ants to death.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4407033847812
    m_Localized: The Black Ant Queen, who saw it happen, was enraged and declared
      war.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4407033847813
    m_Localized: The Black Ant Village demanded an apology, but the Termite Village
      would not give one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4407033847814
    m_Localized: After a long fight, the two exhausted villages finally signed a
      truce.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4407038042112
    m_Localized: But far too many ants had died, and the conflict between the two
      villages remains to this day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906218283008
    m_Localized: "Another peaceful day in the Black Ant Village! But the village
      carries a sad history. 162 years ago by the ant calendar, it went to war with
      the Termite Village \u2014 once a close friend \u2014 and the two have been
      under truce ever since. The termites, who started it all, still have not apologized
      to the black ants. Very bad ants indeed.\nAnd as if that weren't enough, it
      seems those wicked ones are scheming again! Termites have been sneaking into
      the Black Ant Village to disturb its order. For the peace of the Black Ant
      Village, let's find and report every <b>termite</b>. Report enough of them
      and the school will even give you a special award!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906218283009
    m_Localized: Teacher, but a war is when two sides fight each other, isn't it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906218283010
    m_Localized: So if the side that was wrong apologizes first, couldn't they make
      up?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906218283011
    m_Localized: If one side admitted its fault, yes, the conflict would have ended
      peacefully.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906218283012
    m_Localized: But they refuse to admit any fault, and they keep repeating it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906218283013
    m_Localized: If you don't learn history properly, you end up as stubborn as a
      termite.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906218283014
    m_Localized: The reason the termites still haven't apologized to us is their
      distorted history education.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906218283015
    m_Localized: Come to think of it, we covered this last class, didn't we? Does
      anyone remember? Care to answer~?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906218283016
    m_Localized: Why do you suppose the Termite Village teaches such a distorted
      history~?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906218283017
    m_Localized: Me! I know!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906218283018
    m_Localized: It's because termites are abnormal mutants, unlike us black ants!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906218283019
    m_Localized: Yes, that's right~ They are not pure black ants.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906218283020
    m_Localized: They came into being from a mutation in the black ant's genes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906218283021
    m_Localized: Which is why they are far more uncivilized and vicious than we black
      ants.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906218283022
    m_Localized: "\u2026 And lately they have turned up in our Black Ant Village
      once again\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906218283023
    m_Localized: What? Teacher, what do you mean??
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906218283024
    m_Localized: "...Haah. You were going to have to be told anyway\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906218283025
    m_Localized: The truth is, because of them, our Black Ant Village is facing a
      crisis.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906218283026
    m_Localized: Everyone, this is an announcement for all of you, so listen carefully.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906218283027
    m_Localized: <b>Lately, termites have been sneaking into the Black Ant Village.</b>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906218283028
    m_Localized: What?? No way, how could that happen!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906218283029
    m_Localized: What are they sneaking in to do?? Don't tell me they mean to kill
      us in secret?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906218283030
    m_Localized: They are spies sent by the Termite Village.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906218283031
    m_Localized: Not content with contaminating our food stores and destroying village
      property,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906218283032
    m_Localized: the spies were found to have gone after even our young larvae and
      eggs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906218283033
    m_Localized: How cruel...!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906218283034
    m_Localized: Those...! Awful creatures!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906218283035
    m_Localized: And over the past few days, reports keep coming in of termites spotted
      in tunnels all over the village.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906218283036
    m_Localized: The termites are already working from deep inside the Black Ant
      Village to undermine our order.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906218283037
    m_Localized: Then what do we do? We have to catch them, and fast!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906218283038
    m_Localized: "So \u2014 here is the important, truly important thing I must tell
      you all."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906222477312
    m_Localized: <b>If you spot a termite, do not approach it. Report it at once.</b>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906222477313
    m_Localized: Students who find and report many of them will receive a special
      award.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906222477314
    m_Localized: One of you might just get the chance to become the village's hero.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906222477315
    m_Localized: (intrigued)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906222477316
    m_Localized: We're out of time, so that's all for today. Everyone, get home safely~
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906222477317
    m_Localized: Reporting termites, huh... Doesn't sound too hard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906222477318
    m_Localized: I'll catch those bad termites and become the village's hero!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906222477319
    m_Localized: That would make Dad and Mom happy, wouldn't it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906222477320
    m_Localized: Starting today, I'm going to go all over the village and look for
      termites.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906222477322
    m_Localized: I'm home...~
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906222477323
    m_Localized: I'm a little tired, but I think I can manage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906222477324
    m_Localized: ......
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906222477325
    m_Localized: ...... Don't worry, Dad.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906222477326
    m_Localized: I'll protect the village, whatever it takes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906222477327
    m_Localized: That would put your mind at ease a little, wouldn't it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906222477328
    m_Localized: Well then, I'll come say hello again tomorrow. Good night.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906222477329
    m_Localized: Yaaawn, I'm sleepy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676906222477330
    m_Localized: Zzzz....
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424197877760
    m_Localized: Apparently, the pheromones given off by living ants and dead ants
      have different chemical properties. The lesson was hard, so I'd better listen
      closely in class and review whenever I can. By the way, my friend searched
      for termites so hard that they got sick and couldn't come to school!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424214654976
    m_Localized: Today, we're going to learn about the chemicals that come from our
      bodies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849280
    m_Localized: Teacher, one of our classmates isn't here yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849281
    m_Localized: Everyone should get the same lesson, so let's start when they get
      here!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849282
    m_Localized: They let me know they're sick today and can't come~
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849283
    m_Localized: Huh, why? How did they get sick?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849284
    m_Localized: It seems they searched for termites so hard that they wore themselves
      out~
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849285
    m_Localized: That doesn't sound like them at all...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849286
    m_Localized: Anyway, so you don't get sick yourselves, you need to understand
      your own bodies well~
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849287
    m_Localized: There'll be a short quiz after class, so pay attention~
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849288
    m_Localized: Okay...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849289
    m_Localized: Now, the molecular structure on the left is the pheromone molecule
      given off by the body of a living ant.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849290
    m_Localized: Every living ant gives this off, whether it's a black ant or a termite.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849291
    m_Localized: But the body of a dead ant gives off a completely different substance,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849292
    m_Localized: a substance called <b>oleic acid</b>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849293
    m_Localized: All ants judge whether another ant is alive or dead by whether its
      body gives off oleic acid.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849294
    m_Localized: Teacher, does oleic acid only come from the bodies of dead ants?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849295
    m_Localized: Not at all. It's also the most common fatty acid found in nature.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849296
    m_Localized: They say olive oil is especially rich in it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849297
    m_Localized: Teacher, then what happens if oleic acid gets on a living ant?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849298
    m_Localized: Good question. If you were to put oleic acid on a living ant......
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849299
    m_Localized: <b>it could be mistaken for a dead ant.</b>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849300
    m_Localized: Hmm... But when we black ants die, our bodies turn white, don't
      they?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849301
    m_Localized: So even looking at a perfectly healthy black body, they'd think
      it's dead just because of some oleic acid?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849302
    m_Localized: How could anyone make a mistake like that?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849303
    m_Localized: It's only natural to have doubts like that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849304
    m_Localized: But everyone, there's one fact you mustn't overlook.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849305
    m_Localized: For us ants, 'sight' isn't a very reliable sense.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849306
    m_Localized: I don't get what you mean, Teacher.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849307
    m_Localized: As you all know, we ants have poor eyesight, so we rely heavily
      on pheromones.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849308
    m_Localized: So we end up trusting what pheromones tell us more than what we
      see.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849309
    m_Localized: Which means, if the oleic acid is strong enough,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849310
    m_Localized: <b>even a black ant that's clearly alive will 'feel' pure white,
      as if it were dead.</b>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849311
    m_Localized: Now then, let's have a quick quiz on what we've learned so far.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849312
    m_Localized: First question. When an ant dies, what substance does its body give
      off~?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849313
    m_Localized: Oleic acid!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849314
    m_Localized: "Ol\xE9 ol\xE9!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849315
    m_Localized: That's correct~
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849316
    m_Localized: What, are you cheering at a soccer match~?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849317
    m_Localized: Second question. Which of these two does an ant perceive more strongly~?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849318
    m_Localized: Pheromones!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849319
    m_Localized: Visual information!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849320
    m_Localized: Correct~ You were listening well~
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849321
    m_Localized: Weren't you paying attention in class~?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849322
    m_Localized: Alright, let's wrap up today's class here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849323
    m_Localized: Today's lesson may be a little difficult, so reviewing is a must~
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424218849324
    m_Localized: Hmm, maybe I should go visit my friend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043584
    m_Localized: But first, I need to look for termites even harder!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043585
    m_Localized: Today, let's try somewhere other than where I went yesterday.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043586
    m_Localized: A typical spy would go after the enemy's most important places,
      right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043587
    m_Localized: In our last history class, they said rations were important...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043588
    m_Localized: This time, I'll look for termites at the village food storehouse.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043589
    m_Localized: After school, I was going to visit my sick friend, but on the way
      I ran into another friend. And guess what, they made me a tempting offer. They
      said they'd found a secret passage the termites use to sneak in! Now they want
      me to come along... Ahh, visiting my friend or the secret passage, where should
      I go?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043590
    m_Localized: I noticed it last time too, but there's always a rotten smell around
      those guys.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043591
    m_Localized: Ugh, that's so gross.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043592
    m_Localized: Still, I think I worked harder today than yesterday, so I'll head
      home early.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043593
    m_Localized: Oh, right, I should stop by my friend's house.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043594
    m_Localized: Heyyy~ Emil~~!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043595
    m_Localized: You scared me! Oh, it's just you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043596
    m_Localized: Why so jumpy? Got a guilty conscience?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043597
    m_Localized: Anyway, good timing. Come somewhere with me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043598
    m_Localized: Where?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043599
    m_Localized: Heh heh, try not to be too shocked.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043600
    m_Localized: (looks around)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043601
    m_Localized: Come closer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043602
    m_Localized: What is it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043603
    m_Localized: ... I think I found the termites' secret passage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043604
    m_Localized: ......
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043605
    m_Localized: ... What?!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043606
    m_Localized: Shhhhh!! It's not certain yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043607
    m_Localized: If you found a secret passage, we could block it so those guys can't
      invade us, right?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043608
    m_Localized: <b>Or we could invade the Termite Village instead.</b>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043609
    m_Localized: ...... You seriously want to sneak into their village?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043610
    m_Localized: We'll think about that later. Anyway, I'm about to go look for that
      secret passage...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043611
    m_Localized: If you've got time, want to come look for it with me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043612
    m_Localized: I'd love to, but I think I should visit our friend first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043613
    m_Localized: Sure, I'm in!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043614
    m_Localized: Seriously, Emil, you're too nice for your own good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043615
    m_Localized: Then I'll check it out today and tell you at school tomorrow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043616
    m_Localized: There's no school tomorrow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043617
    m_Localized: Oh, right. I forgot. Then I'll tell you in three days!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043618
    m_Localized: I'd better hurry to my friend's house before it gets any later.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043619
    m_Localized: Knew it! With you along, we'll find it in no time!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043620
    m_Localized: '? Didn''t you say you already found it?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043621
    m_Localized: I said I 'think' I found it, not that I found it, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043622
    m_Localized: ...?! Hey!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043623
    m_Localized: No take-backs~~ Now hurry up and follow me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4015424223043624
    m_Localized: Ugh, come on...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697482670080
    m_Localized: 'I went to visit my sick friend, but they didn''t look well at all.
      Their body looked pale, and above all, they were tied up tight!

      Then
      it sounded like someone was coming in, so I quickly hid. The ones who came
      into my friend''s room were grown-up ants I''d never seen before. They talked
      about things I couldn''t understand, and then said they''d take my friend to
      ''the Underground.'''
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697486864384
    m_Localized: I think their house was this way...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697486864385
    m_Localized: Oh, there it is!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697486864386
    m_Localized: Huh, but why is a soldier ant guarding the entrance?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697486864387
    m_Localized: And isn't that a fully armed scout?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697486864388
    m_Localized: What on earth is going on...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697486864389
    m_Localized: Kid, hanging around here is dange ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697486864390
    m_Localized: ...... Wait, are you Emil?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697486864391
    m_Localized: (?!?! How does that ant know my name?)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697491058688
    m_Localized: Don't you recognize me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697491058689
    m_Localized: I'm your dad's friend. Don't you remember?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697491058690
    m_Localized: ...?!! Could it be... Mr. Aphid?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697491058691
    m_Localized: That's right! Look how much you've grown.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697491058692
    m_Localized: ...... I'm truly sorry about your dad. I don't know what else to
      say.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697491058693
    m_Localized: Oh, no, it's okay. ...There was nothing anyone could do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697491058694
    m_Localized: Still, I'm sorry. As his comrade, I should have protected both your
      dad and you...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697491058695
    m_Localized: Has your dad recovered much by now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697491058696
    m_Localized: What? But Dad passed away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697491058697
    m_Localized: What? What are you talking about?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697491058698
    m_Localized: They told me termite guerrillas ambushed him on patrol and he died.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697491058699
    m_Localized: ...... That's
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697491058700
    m_Localized: "Phweeeeeet \u2015 !"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697491058701
    m_Localized: What's that sound??
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697491058702
    m_Localized: Wh, what?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697491058703
    m_Localized: ???!!!! What do you think you're doing!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697491058704
    m_Localized: Shift change. Come with us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697491058705
    m_Localized: Shift change, my foot. Who does a shift change like this?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697491058706
    m_Localized: "Besides, there aren't any soldier ants left to take over. Most
      of the able-bodied ones\u2015"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697491058707
    m_Localized: Quit talking and come quietly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697491058708
    m_Localized: We're taking the kid too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697491058709
    m_Localized: Huh, what? Where'd the brat go?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697491058710
    m_Localized: Ah.. damn it. Hey!! Everyone, search the area first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697491058711
    m_Localized: ...Ugh. I think I fell too hard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697491058712
    m_Localized: Where did they drag Mr. Aphid off to, and why?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697491058713
    m_Localized: If he hadn't pushed me in here, would I have been taken too?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697491058714
    m_Localized: ......
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697491058715
    m_Localized: W, well, since I'm already inside... I should check if my friend
      is okay.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697491058716
    m_Localized: But why is the house so quiet? Is nobody home?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697491058717
    m_Localized: ??? What's that?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697491058718
    m_Localized: Mmph...! Mmmph...!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697491058719
    m_Localized: Wait, why are you all tied up like this?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697491058720
    m_Localized: Hold on, let me untie this first!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697495252992
    m_Localized: (Footsteps)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697495252993
    m_Localized: '!! Footsteps... someone''s coming in!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697495252994
    m_Localized: I'd better hide in that corner for now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697495252995
    m_Localized: (Footsteps)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697495252996
    m_Localized: My, such a young worker ant. What a pity.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697495252997
    m_Localized: Then shall we keep it here under watch instead of sending it to
      'the Underground'?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697495252998
    m_Localized: No. We can't make exceptions in matters like this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697495252999
    m_Localized: I'll have the soldier ants take it to 'the Underground' when they
      return.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697495253000
    m_Localized: How's the leak situation? Have there been many reports?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697495253001
    m_Localized: The report rate is high, so we should wrap things up sooner than
      expected.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697495253002
    m_Localized: Already? Impressive. So quickly...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697495253003
    m_Localized: That was quite the brilliant idea of yours.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697495253004
    m_Localized: Not at all. Getting them to report 'termites' is nothing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697495253005
    m_Localized: If we say the other side attacked first, even 'Mother' will find
      it hard to argue.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697495253006
    m_Localized: ... But I still don't understand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697495253007
    m_Localized: Why 'Mother' keeps protecting the Termite Queen even now...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697495253008
    m_Localized: Well, our Queen and the Termite Queen have always been especially
      close.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697495253009
    m_Localized: I suppose they confided in each other quite a lot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697495253010
    m_Localized: About how to make their colonies flourish, perhaps...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697495253011
    m_Localized: Or how to abandon their colonies and secretly run away? Hahaha.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697495253012
    m_Localized: That joke goes too far. 'Mother' would be furious if she heard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697495253013
    m_Localized: Aren't you awfully uptight for a young ant?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697495253014
    m_Localized: Now, that hurts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697495253015
    m_Localized: Ah, the soldier ants seem to be here. Let's take it now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697495253016
    m_Localized: ......
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697495253017
    m_Localized: Are they all gone?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697495253018
    m_Localized: Mr. Aphid, my friend... where were they all taken?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697495253019
    m_Localized: ... Let's go home for now. Who knows what'll happen if I stay here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697495253020
    m_Localized: ...... They said 'the Underground,' right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697495253021
    m_Localized: The places deep down in the village are... the waste disposal site
      and the corpse disposal site.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697495253022
    m_Localized: I'll get some sleep, then head straight to the waste disposal site
      when I wake up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697495253023
    m_Localized: 'I went to visit my sick friend, but they didn''t look well at all.
      Their body looked pale, and above all, they were tied up tight!

      Then
      it sounded like someone was coming in, so I quickly hid. The ones who came
      into my friend''s room were grown-up ants I''d never seen before. They talked
      about things I couldn''t understand, and then said they''d take my friend to
      ''the Underground.'''
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697495253024
    m_Localized: There were quite a few termites here too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697495253025
    m_Localized: But there's no sign of my friend or Mr. Aphid, not on the way here
      and not here either.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697495253026
    m_Localized: Emil! Is that you, Emil?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697499447296
    m_Localized: Hm? What? Who's calling my name...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697499447297
    m_Localized: Emil! Thank goodness.. You've grown up so healthy!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697499447298
    m_Localized: Gasp! There's still a termite left!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697499447299
    m_Localized: Guard! There's a termite left over here!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697499447300
    m_Localized: Wait! Just hear me out!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697499447301
    m_Localized: (Bang bang)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697499447302
    m_Localized: Aaaaagh!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697499447303
    m_Localized: Huff, huff...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697499447304
    m_Localized: What on earth has been going on since yesterday?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697499447305
    m_Localized: Ugh, my head hurts. I feel like my whole body reeks of rot!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697499447306
    m_Localized: I need to wash up, fast!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697499447307
    m_Localized: I followed my friend to the waste disposal site. I thought they'd
      already found the termites' secret passage, but now they say we're going to
      look for it together. Huh!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697499447308
    m_Localized: This is the first time I've ever come down this deep.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697499447309
    m_Localized: Is this your first time at the waste disposal site?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697499447310
    m_Localized: Yeah. How many times have you been here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697499447311
    m_Localized: My dad used to work here. I came by a few times to meet him when
      he got off work.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697499447312
    m_Localized: I see.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697499447313
    m_Localized: Alright, shall we start looking for the secret passage?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697499447314
    m_Localized: I'll check over here, so you look over there, Emil.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697499447315
    m_Localized: Got it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697499447316
    m_Localized: By the way, the smell here is awful... I don't think I can search
      for long.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697499447317
    m_Localized: Still, isn't this the perfect place for guys like the termites to
      hide?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697499447318
    m_Localized: And I don't know if you've noticed, but those guys give off a nasty
      stench.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697499447319
    m_Localized: I bet it soaked into them from hiding in places just like this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697499447320
    m_Localized: Anyway, if we stay here too long I'm going to pass out, so let's
      search fast and get out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697499447321
    m_Localized: Obviously. Let's meet up again out front.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697499447322
    m_Localized: While I'm at it, I should check for any hidden termites too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697499447323
    m_Localized: I put up with the awful smell, reported every termite I spotted,
      and searched for the secret passage, but came up with nothing much. Even more
      ridiculous, my friend went home before me, even though they were the one who
      dragged me there! Next time I see them at school, I want to give them a good
      bonk on the head.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697503641600
    m_Localized: There were quite a few termites here too, but...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697503641601
    m_Localized: I don't see anything that looks like a secret passage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697503641602
    m_Localized: Ugh, I just want to get out of here! I can't stand this smell anymore!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697503641603
    m_Localized: How long is that guy planning to keep looking?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697503641604
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697503641605
    m_Localized: ... Obviously. It's been posted for days now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697503641606
    m_Localized: Has it? I only saw it today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697503641607
    m_Localized: It's an important notice, so make sure you read it carefully.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697503641608
    m_Localized: They say that stuff doesn't come off easily once it gets on you,
      right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697503641609
    m_Localized: It's oil-based or something, I think.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697503641610
    m_Localized: Reckon that's why they want us extra careful. Don't get it on yourselves
      while working.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697503641611
    m_Localized: But why are they telling us not to tell anyone outside?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697503641612
    m_Localized: If word got out that something like that exists, you think the residents
      would stay calm?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697503641613
    m_Localized: Better they don't know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697503641614
    m_Localized: You think? I still feel like knowing is better than not knowing...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697503641615
    m_Localized: Anyway, you lot keep your mouths shut too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697503641616
    m_Localized: ...... What were they talking about?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697503641617
    m_Localized: (Footsteps)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697503641618
    m_Localized: Ah, looks like he's finally coming out!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697503641619
    m_Localized: Hey! What took you so lo..!?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697503641620
    m_Localized: Whoa, you startled me. Kid, what are you doing in a place like this?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697503641621
    m_Localized: Oh no, I'm sorry. I thought you were my friend...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697503641622
    m_Localized: This isn't a playground. Hurry on home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697503641623
    m_Localized: Yes, I'm sorry. But my friend still hasn't come out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697503641624
    m_Localized: Did you happen to see an ant about my age inside?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697503641625
    m_Localized: Hmm, well. I don't think I did.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697503641626
    m_Localized: We always do one last round before we come out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697507835904
    m_Localized: Maybe that friend of yours went home first?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697507835905
    m_Localized: Oh, that could be it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697507835906
    m_Localized: Thank you for letting me know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697507835907
    m_Localized: Alright, you head home too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697507835908
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697507835909
    m_Localized: What, he just left without even saying bye?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697507835910
    m_Localized: After dragging me here himself....
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697507835911
    m_Localized: Tch, if I'd known, I should've just gone to visit my friend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697507835912
    m_Localized: It's kind of too late to go to my friend's house now, too...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697507835913
    m_Localized: Guess I'll just go home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697507835914
    m_Localized: I need to wash off this smell that's soaked into me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697507835915
    m_Localized: Phew~ That feels so refreshing~
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697507835916
    m_Localized: Tomorrow and the day after are days off from school, so...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8703697507835917
    m_Localized: I'll go search for more passages the termites might use.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629920358400
    m_Localized: "Even more of my friends came down sick from searching for termites.
      Too bad I can't give my friend that bonk on the head. \nAnyway, the teacher
      found out that I visited my sick friend and went to the waste disposal site.
      The teacher urged me to be careful around termites, since I could get hurt
      just like my other friends. \nBut...... that only makes me want to expose the
      termites for sure!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552704
    m_Localized: There seem to be a lot of empty seats today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552705
    m_Localized: I was running around all over the place even while school was off..
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552706
    m_Localized: But I couldn't find a passage the termites might use, or the place
      called 'the Underground'...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552707
    m_Localized: I wonder if the others had any luck?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552708
    m_Localized: Lots of empty seats today, aren't there?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552709
    m_Localized: It seems everyone has been working a little too hard at catching
      termites.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552710
    m_Localized: I certainly didn't expect you all to go this far.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552711
    m_Localized: (Looks like I'm not the only one who's been out hunting for termites.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552712
    m_Localized: <b>Isn't that right, Emil?</b>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552713
    m_Localized: ...?? Huh? Me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552714
    m_Localized: Could you step out for a moment?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552715
    m_Localized: Okay...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552716
    m_Localized: ......Um, Teacher. Did I do something wrong?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552717
    m_Localized: Did you, by any chance, go to your friend's house to visit them
      while they were sick?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552718
    m_Localized: (Why would the teacher suddenly ask me that?)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552719
    m_Localized: Emil, answer me. Did you go visit your friend?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552720
    m_Localized: Uh... well...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552721
    m_Localized: <b>Emil, everyone is watching. So you mustn't lie.</b>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552722
    m_Localized: ('Everyone'? What does that mean?)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552723
    m_Localized: (Somehow I feel like I'd get caught even if I lied...)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552724
    m_Localized: ...Yes, I went.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552725
    m_Localized: ... How was your friend? Did they seem to be feeling much better?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552726
    m_Localized: ......Actually, the truth is...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552727
    m_Localized: <b>... I couldn't go in. It looked like a soldier ant was guarding
      the entrance...</b>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552728
    m_Localized: ... Is that true?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552729
    m_Localized: Yes... um... I mean,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552730
    m_Localized: I did go, but I didn't get to see my friend...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552731
    m_Localized: ...Sigh. I see......
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552732
    m_Localized: It's sweet of you to care about your friend, but you could catch
      a virus or something,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552733
    m_Localized: so please avoid visiting sick friends if you can.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552734
    m_Localized: And as I've stressed before, even when you report a termite, you
      must never go near those things.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552735
    m_Localized: The trouble is, our students are a little too eager...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552736
    m_Localized: All you need to do is report them. Understood?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552737
    m_Localized: Yes, Teacher.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552738
    m_Localized: Your father was hurt because of the termites too, in a way, Emil,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552739
    m_Localized: ......
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552740
    m_Localized: so I fully understand why you're so eager to catch them. But,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552741
    m_Localized: the other students, and you too, Emil, are still young ants.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552742
    m_Localized: So above all else, you need to look out for your own safety.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552743
    m_Localized: ......Yes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552744
    m_Localized: ......
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552745
    m_Localized: I know the teacher is worried about me, but...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552746
    m_Localized: ...I still want to find every last termite.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552747
    m_Localized: I just can't forgive those termites for hurting Dad and my friends.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552748
    m_Localized: ...... Yeah, it has to be the termites..! All of this must be happening
      because of them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552749
    m_Localized: ...Maybe the place called 'the Underground' is where they treat
      the ones who got hurt by the termites?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552750
    m_Localized: "Mr. Aphid too... he got dragged off th\u2014 no, no, they must
      have taken him there because he needed help."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552751
    m_Localized: I still haven't found where 'the Underground' is, but...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552752
    m_Localized: I'd be in trouble if the teacher caught me wandering around searching
      again,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552753
    m_Localized: so this time I'll look for termites and the secret passage somewhere
      more out of the way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552754
    m_Localized: Somewhere even fewer ants ever go... Hmm...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552755
    m_Localized: ...Oh, that's it! The corpse disposal site!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552756
    m_Localized: That awful stench coming off those termites... it felt different
      from plain garbage smell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552757
    m_Localized: ... If anything, it was closer to the smell of the corpse in Dad's
      coffin.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552758
    m_Localized: Maybe that's where the termites are sneaking in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552759
    m_Localized: After class today, I'll go check out the corpse disposal site.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552760
    m_Localized: Just as I thought, that rotten stench coming off the termites really
      was the smell of corpses!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552761
    m_Localized: Could the termites' secret passage really be hidden somewhere around
      here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552762
    m_Localized: Hmm... I don't have time to search this whole place right now...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552763
    m_Localized: ...And if things go wrong and the termites attack me too,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552764
    m_Localized: I won't be able to face Dad, even after I die.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552765
    m_Localized: Once my friends get better, I'll ask them to search with me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552766
    m_Localized: "Even more of my friends came down sick from searching for termites.
      Looks like the friend who dragged me to the waste disposal site came down sick
      too. Too bad, now I won't get to give them that bonk on the head. \nAnyway,
      that awful smell at the waste disposal site felt a little different from the
      smell coming off the termites. It was more like...... the smell of a corpse,
      the one I once smelled from Dad's coffin. \nIt's a little scary, but today
      I'm going to the corpse disposal site to look for the termites' secret passage."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552767
    m_Localized: There seem to be a lot of empty seats today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552768
    m_Localized: I was running around all over the place even while school was off,
      but
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552769
    m_Localized: I couldn't find a single passage entrance the termites might use...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552770
    m_Localized: I wonder if the others had any luck?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552771
    m_Localized: Lots of empty seats today, aren't there?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552772
    m_Localized: It seems everyone has been working a little too hard at catching
      termites.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552773
    m_Localized: I certainly didn't expect you all to go this far.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552774
    m_Localized: (Looks like I'm not the only one who's been out hunting for termites.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552775
    m_Localized: (Even that heartless guy who ditched me at the waste disposal site
      is absent.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552776
    m_Localized: I can't believe everyone was this serious about reporting termites...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552777
    m_Localized: I'd better step it up too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552778
    m_Localized: Think, Emil... think...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552779
    m_Localized: Where might the termites be coming out from...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552780
    m_Localized: ......
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552781
    m_Localized: Come to think of it, that awful smell coming off those guys,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552782
    m_Localized: it felt a little different from the smell of the waste disposal
      site.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552783
    m_Localized: ...... It was something I once smelled from Dad's coffin...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552784
    m_Localized: That's right, if anything, it was closer to <b>the smell of a corpse</b>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552785
    m_Localized: ...... A smell I could never forget...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552786
    m_Localized: My dad was a soldier ant, and a scout.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552787
    m_Localized: He was away from home far more often than he was there,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552788
    m_Localized: but whenever he was with me, he loved me with everything he had.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552789
    m_Localized: And I loved him for it, and looked up to him, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552790
    m_Localized: Nine years ago by the ant calendar, Dad left home like any other
      day,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629924552791
    m_Localized: and didn't come back for a very, very long time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629928747008
    m_Localized: I went looking for him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629928747009
    m_Localized: I asked the grown-ups in the village, but got nowhere.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629928747010
    m_Localized: The adult worker ants only said that soldier ants' work was different
      from theirs, so they didn't really know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629928747011
    m_Localized: A very long time passed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629928747012
    m_Localized: Long enough for me to make my own meals, clean the house, go to
      school,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629928747013
    m_Localized: pack my own school things, and study hard, all by myself. That much
      time passed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629928747014
    m_Localized: Then one day, my homeroom teacher told me that Dad had passed away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629928747015
    m_Localized: I barely remember how I got to the funeral after that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629928747016
    m_Localized: When I came to my senses, all that was in front of me was a cold,
      unfeeling coffin.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629928747017
    m_Localized: A worker ant who said he had worked with Dad told me what had happened.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629928747018
    m_Localized: Dad had gone out on patrol like any other day,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629928747019
    m_Localized: and was killed when termite guerrillas suddenly sprang out from
      behind the grass and ambushed him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629928747020
    m_Localized: Patrols were supposed to stay together, but in the one moment Dad
      had drifted too far from the others,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629928747021
    m_Localized: the termites pounced on him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629928747022
    m_Localized: That day, I buried my face against Dad's coffin and cried until
      I passed out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629928747023
    m_Localized: I never even got to see Dad's body with my own eyes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629928747024
    m_Localized: It was too gruesome, and I was better off not seeing it... or so
      the grown-ups said.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629928747025
    m_Localized: That was the day I made up my mind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629928747026
    m_Localized: That no matter what, I would avenge my dad.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629928747027
    m_Localized: ......
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629928747028
    m_Localized: In our village, the only place that reeks of corpses strongly enough
      for the smell to soak into your body
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629928747029
    m_Localized: has to be the corpse disposal site, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629928747030
    m_Localized: Maybe that's where the termites are sneaking in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629928747031
    m_Localized: After class today, I'll go check out the corpse disposal site.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629928747032
    m_Localized: Some of those termites' faces looked kind of familiar... I'm just
      imagining it, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629928747033
    m_Localized: I have been hunting termites nonstop lately... I feel like I see
      them more often than my friends.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629928747034
    m_Localized: Anyway, just as I thought, that rotten stench coming off the termites
      really was the smell of corpses!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629928747035
    m_Localized: Could the termites' secret passage really be hidden somewhere around
      here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629928747036
    m_Localized: Hmm... I don't have time to search this whole place right now...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629928747037
    m_Localized: ...And if things go wrong and the termites attack me too,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629928747038
    m_Localized: I won't be able to face Dad, even after I die.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14880629928747039
    m_Localized: Once my friends get better, I'll ask them to search with me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
